# rows-arrows (H4): the pointer on a's left chevron (291, 299) and clicked —
# the chevrons are decorative (no handler at this hash), so the card is
# unchanged and the URL keeps nothing.
# Coordinates are this tree's (the function card is 104 tall without
# the readout): row a/k/b/h at y 277/321/382/426. h4-readout grows the
# function card by 133.5, landing rows at the reference y; flip back then.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 291 299
wait 150
click 291 299
wait 200
shot rows-arrows
